{"h":11508,"lines":[{"text":"disturbs and vexes it constantly. Although its eyes are sealed","y":0.92971958152069534,"conf":1,"w":0.8150425204983005,"x":0.10676104230063824,"h":0.023811868258884927},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"and it does not see the judgment which is invisibly being","y":0.90988372132380002,"h":0.020423818202245814,"x":0.10688838064964615,"conf":1},{"x":0.10451305718447204,"text":"executed upon it, it has an uneasy and vexing suspicion that","conf":1,"y":0.88516865035076853,"w":0.81947742808948876,"h":0.021825396825396859},{"conf":1,"x":0.10451307956379609,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.02183116428435794,"text":"this is so. It desires that this word, which assails its self-","y":0.86334325389658018},{"h":0.02481293772894233,"text":"sufficiency and claimfulness, should cease to be heard and it","conf":1,"x":0.10199056828316805,"y":0.83864948764829428,"w":0.82216114192814027},{"w":0.32132453423041807,"text":"attempts to suppress it.","y":0.81575601036913448,"x":0.10412897735203616,"h":0.023276603411114372,"conf":1},{"y":0.79499280075004741,"text":"By the word we do not mean only the word of the preacher","x":0.13533057356907024,"w":0.7863687292321937,"conf":1,"h":0.021951743534633028},{"h":0.022821490726773641,"text":"which is heard in church; the witness to Christ has taken","y":0.77234037563340741,"x":0.10207182011597825,"w":0.81724518614929997,"conf":1},{"w":0.81947742808948865,"text":"many various forms and whatever the form, it vexes the","x":0.10213776368684725,"h":0.021825396825396748,"y":0.75000000015724022,"conf":1},{"text":"spirit of the world. It may take the form of works of Christian","x":0.10198660089693506,"y":0.72686051075599645,"w":0.81738628040660521,"h":0.023315648237864139,"conf":1},{"x":0.10213777974979224,"w":0.81947742808948854,"conf":1,"y":0.70486111087758374,"h":0.021883075199430002,"text":"charity; such activity is a word which speaks and testifies"},{"y":0.6830357145142385,"conf":1,"x":0.10213777137687088,"h":0.021906145981379854,"text":"to Jesus. But as such it is provoking to the world. Certainly","w":0.81947742808948876},{"conf":1,"y":0.65988372144478857,"x":0.10213777868090869,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021911913440341158,"text":"the world admits the necessity of such works, but only in the"},{"h":0.020400747420295851,"conf":1,"text":"guise of secular philanthropy. Or the word of Christ may","x":0.10213778075929343,"y":0.63808139570087641,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"text":"have taken shape in art, poetry and music, in painting and","conf":1,"y":0.61334325380573718,"h":0.02183116428435794,"w":0.81710211023107748,"x":0.10213778550203829},{"h":0.02036613982821267,"y":0.5930059527557946,"x":0.099762465408937517,"w":0.81947742808948854,"text":"sculpture. The world gladly admits the beauty of the artistic","conf":1},{"text":"expression and claims that as its own. But the Word thus","conf":1,"x":0.10213777315049463,"w":0.81710211023107737,"y":0.56969246067799917,"h":0.021877306794363394},{"h":0.021802325097341479,"conf":1,"y":0.54651162820956578,"text":"embodied is hateful to it. Nevertheless this word, which so","x":0.10213778779815863,"w":0.81710211023107748},{"y":0.5232558139774921,"w":0.81947742808948865,"h":0.021883075199429891,"x":0.099762473437440907,"conf":1,"text":"vexes and disturbs the world, gives to the Christian disciple"},{"text":"the power to challenge the world; for he knows that by the","conf":1,"x":0.099681584686271141,"y":0.50131937428029849,"w":0.8196315517673245,"h":0.021985593296232619},{"text":"mighty Word the sway of the prince of this world is","w":0.81947742808948876,"y":0.47965116308044464,"conf":1,"x":0.099762467750301509,"h":0.020348836505223789},{"y":0.46063049356750985,"h":0.017692501582796671,"w":0.13785182655631723,"x":0.097344871425773194,"text":"shattered.","conf":1},{"y":0.42586280759918504,"x":0.27032499928501402,"w":0.3475738872181286,"h":0.023505142756870767,"conf":1,"text":"\"And let the prince of ill"},{"w":0.35391923978731227,"x":0.28978622628607459,"y":0.4040178568546029,"text":"Look grim as e'er he will,","conf":1,"h":0.020400747420295851},{"w":0.33966745649065289,"h":0.018970329610128234,"conf":1,"text":"He harms us not a whit;","y":0.38219246061095979,"x":0.32066508070954292},{"h":0.020452657389262385,"text":"For why?—his doom is writ;","conf":1,"y":0.35901162822994614,"x":0.32066508887690187,"w":0.39667456490652903},{"conf":1,"text":"A word shall quickly slay him.\"1","y":0.33575581401282872,"w":0.45843228426846594,"x":0.28741093243029603,"h":0.023371170437525235},{"conf":1,"y":0.29786706307985189,"h":0.019097222222222321,"text":"1 Luther; tr. Thomas Carlyle.","x":0.36342043277722247,"w":0.31591447607263345},{"conf":1,"x":0.48456056997498442,"y":0.072674419259771472,"w":0.038004751329298148,"h":0.01744185932098874,"text":"70"}],"page":66,"w":7029}